:: MP Companion Quest Stage 0 [nobr]
<<effects>>
<<run window.dolmp && window.dolmp.syncCompanionToVariables && window.dolmp.syncCompanionToVariables()>>
<<set _comp to ($mpCompanion or { name: "艾琳", pronoun: "f", gender: "f", attitude: "meek" })>>
<<set $mpInteractTargetName to _comp.name>>
<<generateNPC 1 "a" _comp.pronoun _comp.gender>>
<<person1>>
在孤儿院房间的书桌最下层，<<print $mpInteractTargetName>>取出一只上了锁的胡桃木小盒。打开盒盖，里面躺着半块停摆的银质怀表与一张字迹模糊的当票，上面盖着旧街区钟表行的火漆印记。
<br><br>
"这是我刚来孤儿院时身上唯一留下的东西，"<<he>>轻声说道，"听说另一半表壳和当年的线索落在高街与商业区小巷的暗处，我想找回它，又怕贝利发现后拿去抵债。"
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[答应陪<<him>>一起暗中寻回线索 (0:20)|MP Companion Quest Stage 0 Res A]]>><<pass 20>><<set $mpCompanionQuest to 1>><<set $antiquemoney to ($antiquemoney or 0) + 25>><<set $blackmoney to ($blackmoney or 0) + 0>><</link>><<glove>><<gtrust>>
<br>
<<loveicon "hug">><<link [[在房间里替<<him>>仔细擦拭保养怀表 (0:20)|MP Companion Quest Stage 0 Res B]]>><<pass 20>><<set $mpCompanionQuest to 1>><<set $antiquemoney to ($antiquemoney or 0) + 25>><<stress -8>><<arousal 800>><</link>><<lstress>><<glove>><<garousal>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[提醒<<him>>当心贝利的耳目 (0:20)|MP Companion Quest Stage 0 Res C]]>><<pass 20>><<set $mpCompanionQuest to 1>><<set $blackmoney to ($blackmoney or 0) + 0>><<skulduggery 4>><</link>><<gskulduggery>><<gtrust>>

